  <item>
    <title>003 也许群星璀璨耀眼，但你那颗独一无二</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668521560bc5d7cc708a8142</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668521560bc5d7cc708a8142</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jul 2024 10:00:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>如果说广阔世界是宇宙长河，那生活在其中的我们就是一颗颗美好的星星。我们相遇、碰撞；绽放，消亡。</span></h2><span></span><p><span>也许偶尔会迷失，因为他人身上的光芒是如此夺目，而我们似乎渺小如尘埃。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但发光不是宇宙的唯一，我们身体的纹路，我们内核的温度，我们转动的方向，我们所在的坐标，都证明着我们是这世界上独一无二的那颗，无论发光还是暗淡，都无可替代。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以请拥抱身边的人，感恩我们在浩瀚宇宙中彼此吸引，彼此陪伴；所以请拥抱自己，也许群星璀璨耀眼，但你那颗独一无二。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">00:01:35</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:发光与暗淡伴随着对比，但标准具有多样性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">00:04:34</a> </span><em><span>燕姐</span></em><span>:顶尖与独特是核心特质，分享我的辩论历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">00:10:46</a> </span><em><span>莉莉娅</span></em><span>:发光应该是个人努力，而非先天注定；平凡≠暗淡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">00:16:13</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:完成一场很好的pre是我的发光，蜕变源于不care他人的目光</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们喜欢的发光者有什么共同特质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">00:19:36</a> </span><em><span>莉莉娅</span></em><span>:发光者的态度很重要，锐利的光芒是一把匕首</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">00:20:58</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:勇于做自己的人闪闪发光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">00:21:47</a> </span><em><span>燕姐</span></em><span>:我们对发光的评价体系太单一，是否有可能挣脱思维的懒惰，建自己的游戏规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">00:25:22</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:习惯性的比较带来无止境的痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">00:29:50</a></span><em><span> 莉莉娅</span></em><span>:社会的激励机制让我们聚焦于发光的赢家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">00:36:58</a> </span><em><span>莉莉娅</span></em><span>:做比较是一件普遍的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2273">00:37:53</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:发现自己习惯比较，于是尝试挣脱比较</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">00:40:32</a> </span><em><span>燕姐</span></em><span>:某些比较也会让人找到自己的坐标，促进自身成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">00:41:23</a> 有关学人精:模仿并不丢人，独特性并不依赖于表面元素，光的存在固然重要，但光的形成更加重要。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2777">00:46:17</a> 如何避免落入比较陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3008">00:50:08</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:社会影响我们对发光与暗淡的感受，学历崇拜就是典型例证</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">00:53:20</a> 我们如何在发光与暗淡之间安置自己的内心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3230">00:53:50</a> </span><em><span>燕姐</span></em><span>:既不轻视自己，也不把自己看得太过重要。创造自己的“主角游戏”才是关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">00:55:00</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:以刘翔为例，我们应该对他人在发光与暗淡之间的落差保有宽容与平常心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3451">00:57:31</a> 节目的最后，让我们夸夸彼此，也夸夸自己——这宇宙中独一无二的星</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>衍生信息</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>詹姆斯·卡斯《有限与无限的游戏》</span></p><span></span><p><span>八月长安《你好旧时光》</span></p><span></span><p><span>林松果《东京不见叶诗文》</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9X25oZ0A7zYCmRHGU6DzVA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9X25oZ0A7zYCmRHGU6DzVA"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>开场音乐:来源于动画《京剧猫》</span></p><span></span><p><span>引语背景音乐:Cicida 《踏出一条白色的路》</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾音乐:对角巷乐队 《解决一切的方式》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参与录制人员：莉莉娅、茂牛野、燕姐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑&amp;文案：燕姐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>封面：莉莉娅</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（按首字母排序）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpbww-QVsC6svhiflMtPLK_s3Lcp.m4a" length="72007301" type="audio/mp4"/>
