  <item>
    <title>001 请回答2023:以人生大考切割的一年，我们都有哪些感悟（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66098a4e1519139e4fc1b6f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66098a4e1519139e4fc1b6f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Mar 2024 16:07:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:00:14</a> </span><strong><span>高考后面对长久压抑的释放以及对未来的迷茫</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">00:05:29</a> </span><em><span>冷少</span></em><span>:高考后我在家伏低做小，成绩出来翻身做主人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">00:12:00</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:放肆快乐，偶尔焦虑，选择“热爱”还是“划算”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">00:17:36</a> </span><em><span>燕姐</span></em><span>:以形式化的方式标榜社会时钟意义上的成年后，人生是旷野吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">00:20:30</a> </span><em><span>瑞露</span></em><span>:“走一步看一步”的人生哲学，当下的脚步就是最好的选择。 如何重新评估高考对我们人生的意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">00:27:35</a> </span><em><span>瑞露</span></em><span>:高考是人生之书的小小书签，内容则由我书写</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">00:33:12</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:有选择比没有选择好，高考给我选择的权利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">00:37:54</a></span><em><span> 莉莉娅</span></em><span>:高考给我看世界的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">00:39:50</a></span><em><span> 燕姐</span></em><span>:高考不是问题，高考后如何才是问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">00:42:00</a> </span><em><span>冷少</span></em><span>:高考是功利性的跳板，我们无法抹去它的现实与痛苦之处。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>高考后我们都有什么改变？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">00:43:10</a> </span><em><span>冷少</span></em><span>:由E变I，谁偷走了我的社交能力与勇气？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2862">00:47:42</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:外形与社交能量，我们的改变。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3010">00:50:10</a> </span><em><span>瑞露</span></em><span>:更加丰富的生活，更加冗杂的工作。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3114">00:51:54</a> </span><em><span>莉莉娅</span></em><span>:松弛感以及我们苦涩的恋家情结。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3570">00:59:30</a> </span><em><span>燕姐</span></em><span>:高考后，高中校园偶像剧在我心里破灭了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">01:04:00</a> </span><strong><span>作为I人如何适应陌生的城市和专业？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">01:06:00</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:I人不是不能交流，积极打破信息差让我获得安全感。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4179">01:09:39</a> </span><em><span>燕姐</span></em><span>:I与E不是绝对，环境的作用大于十六型人格。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4428">01:13:48</a> </span><em><span>瑞露</span></em><span>:自然融入，天气会影响我的感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4600">01:16:40</a> </span><em><span>莉莉娅:</span></em><span>军训让人吃尽苦头，饮食让人无奈扶额。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">01:20:00</a> </span><strong><span>进入一个新城市后生活里有哪些小确幸</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4820">01:20:20</a> </span><em><span>冷少</span></em><span>:植被与气候，历史与人情。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4930">01:22:10</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:快递速度让幸福感upup，被人记挂让我幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5084">01:24:44</a> </span><em><span>瑞露</span></em><span>:室友、志愿服务、收获新的友谊。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5280">01:28:00</a> </span><em><span>燕姐</span></em><span>:漫无目的的一人时光给我自由，陌生城市的心灵靠近让我幸福。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5440">01:30:40</a> </span><em><span>莉莉娅</span></em><span>:新鲜的植物让我好奇，新鲜的尝试给我思考。2024:我们的展望与计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5766">01:36:06</a></span><em><span> 燕姐</span></em><span>:运动、写作、与朋友建立更多连结。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6200">01:43:20</a> </span><em><span>茂牛野</span></em><span>:身体健康，积极向上。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6390">01:46:30</a> </span><em><span>冷少</span></em><span>:改变坏习惯，取得新收获。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6630">01:50:30</a> </span><em><span>莉莉娅</span></em><span>:在路上——学习、理财、运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6748">01:52:28</a> </span><em><span>瑞露</span></em><span>:克服拖延，邂逅爱情，适应当下的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6880">01:54:40</a> </span><strong><span>ending:祝你春天快乐，想要的都实现！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「衍生信息」</span></p><span></span><p><span>l 片头曲 来源于动画《京剧猫》</span></p><span></span><p><span>l片尾曲 上海彩虹室内合唱团《想要的一定实现》</span></p><span></span><p><span>您可以从以下社交平台收听我们的博客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：先疯鸣宿podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云音乐：先疯鸣宿 </span><a href="http://music.163.com/radio?id=1001284329&amp;userid=9290917488&amp;app_version=9.0.25" data-url="http://music.163.com/radio?id=1001284329&amp;userid=9290917488&amp;app_version=9.0.25"><span>music.163.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
